{"bookId":"NAM","bookName":"Nahum","shortName":"Nah","version":"RVR1909","chaptersCount":3,"chapters":{"1":[{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":1,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Profecía sobre Nínive. Libro de la visión de Nahum de Elcos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Profecía","strong":"4853"},{"word":"Nínive","strong":"5210"},{"word":"Libro","strong":"5612"},{"word":"visión","strong":"2377"},{"word":"Nahum","strong":"5151"},{"word":"Elcos","strong":"512"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":2,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Jehová es Dios celoso y vengador; Jehová es vengador y lleno de indignación; se venga de sus adversarios, y guarda enojo para sus enemigos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3069"},{"word":"Dios","strong":"410"},{"word":"celoso","strong":"7072"},{"word":"vengador","strong":"5358"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3069"},{"word":"vengador","strong":"5358"},{"word":"lleno","strong":"1167"},{"word":"indignación","strong":"2534"},{"word":"venga","strong":"5358"},{"word":"venga","strong":"3069"},{"word":"sus","strong":"1931"},{"word":"adversarios","strong":"6862"},{"word":"y","strong":"1931"},{"word":"enojo","strong":"5201"},{"word":"sus","strong":"1931"},{"word":"enemigos","strong":"341"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":3,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Jehová es tardo para la ira y grande en poder, y no tendrá por inocente al culpable. Jehová marcha, en la tempestad y el torbellino, y las nubes son el polvo de sus pies.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"tardo","strong":"750"},{"word":"ira","strong":"639"},{"word":"y","strong":"1419"},{"word":"y","strong":"5352"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"inocente","strong":"5352"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"marcha","strong":"1870"},{"word":"tempestad","strong":"5492"},{"word":"torbellino","strong":"8183"},{"word":"nubes","strong":"6051"},{"word":"polvo","strong":"80"},{"word":"pies","strong":"7272"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":4,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"El amenaza al mar, y lo hace secar, y agosta todos los ríos; Basán fue destruido, y el Carmelo, y la flor del Líbano fue destruida.","strongTokens":[{"word":"amenaza","strong":"1605"},{"word":"y","strong":"3220"},{"word":"y","strong":"3001"},{"word":"todos","strong":"2717"},{"word":"los","strong":"3605"},{"word":"los","strong":"5104"},{"word":"Basán","strong":"5105"},{"word":"fue","strong":"1316"},{"word":"y","strong":"535"},{"word":"y","strong":"3760"},{"word":"del","strong":"6525"},{"word":"fue","strong":"3844"},{"word":"fue","strong":"536"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":5,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Los montes tiemblan delante de él, y los collados se derriten; la tierra se conmueve a su presencia, y el mundo, y todos los que en él habitan.","strongTokens":[{"word":"tiemblan","strong":"2022"},{"word":"delante","strong":"7493"},{"word":"él","strong":"4480"},{"word":"se","strong":"1389"},{"word":"se","strong":"4127"},{"word":"derriten","strong":"4018"},{"word":"se","strong":"776"},{"word":"se","strong":"6440"},{"word":"a","strong":"5375"},{"word":"su","strong":"4480"},{"word":"y","strong":"8398"},{"word":"los","strong":"3605"},{"word":"los","strong":"3427"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":6,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿Quién permanecerá delante de su ira? ¿y quién quedará en pie en el ardor de su enojo? Su ira se derrama como fuego, y por él se hienden las peñas.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Quién","strong":"6440"},{"word":"Quién","strong":"4310"},{"word":"Quién","strong":"6965"},{"word":"permanecerá","strong":"5975"},{"word":"ira","strong":"2195"},{"word":"quién","strong":"4310"},{"word":"ardor","strong":"2740"},{"word":"enojo","strong":"639"},{"word":"ira","strong":"2534"},{"word":"derrama","strong":"5413"},{"word":"fuego","strong":"784"},{"word":"por","strong":"4480"},{"word":"hienden","strong":"5422"},{"word":"peñas","strong":"6697"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":7,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Jehová es bueno, fortaleza en el día de la angustia; y conoce a los que en él confían.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"bueno","strong":"2896"},{"word":"fortaleza","strong":"4581"},{"word":"día","strong":"3117"},{"word":"angustia","strong":"6869"},{"word":"conoce","strong":"3045"},{"word":"conoce","strong":"2620"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Mas con inundación impetuosa consumirá a sus adversarios, y tinieblas perseguirán a sus enemigos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"inundación","strong":"7858"},{"word":"impetuosa","strong":"5674"},{"word":"consumirá","strong":"3617"},{"word":"consumirá","strong":"6213"},{"word":"adversarios","strong":"4725"},{"word":"tinieblas","strong":"2822"},{"word":"perseguirán","strong":"7291"},{"word":"enemigos","strong":"341"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿Qué pensáis contra Jehová? El hará consumación; no tomará venganza dos veces de sus enemigos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Qué","strong":"4100"},{"word":"pensáis","strong":"2803"},{"word":"contra","strong":"413"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"El","strong":"1931"},{"word":"hará","strong":"6213"},{"word":"consumación","strong":"3617"},{"word":"no","strong":"3808"},{"word":"no","strong":"6965"},{"word":"dos","strong":"6471"},{"word":"dos","strong":"6869"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":1,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Aunque sean como espinos entretejidos, y estén empapados en su embriaguez, serán consumidos como hojarasca completamente seca.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Aunque","strong":"3588"},{"word":"como","strong":"5704"},{"word":"espinos","strong":"5518"},{"word":"entretejidos","strong":"5440"},{"word":"empapados","strong":"5435"},{"word":"embria