 sus fornicaciones, y a los pueblos con sus hechizos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"de","strong":"7230"},{"word":"de","strong":"2183"},{"word":"de","strong":"2181"},{"word":"gracia","strong":"2896"},{"word":"maestra","strong":"2580"},{"word":"maestra","strong":"1172"},{"word":"en","strong":"1191"},{"word":"que","strong":"3785"},{"word":"a","strong":"4376"},{"word":"con","strong":"1471"},{"word":"y","strong":"2183"},{"word":"con","strong":"4940"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":3,"verse":5,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Heme aquí contra ti, dice Jehová de los ejércitos, y descubriré tus faldas en tu rostro, y mostraré a las naciones tu desnudez, y a los reinos tu vergüenza.","strongTokens":[{"word":"contra","strong":"2005"},{"word":"contra","strong":"413"},{"word":"dice","strong":"5002"},{"word":"Jehová","strong":"3068"},{"word":"ejércitos","strong":"6635"},{"word":"descubriré","strong":"1540"},{"word":"faldas","strong":"7757"},{"word":"en","strong":"5921"},{"word":"en","strong":"6440"},{"word":"mostraré","strong":"7200"},{"word":"naciones","strong":"1471"},{"word":"desnudez","strong":"4626"},{"word":"reinos","strong":"4467"},{"word":"vergüenza","strong":"7036"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":3,"verse":6,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Y echaré sobre ti inmundicias, y te afrentaré, y te pondré como estiércol.","strongTokens":[{"word":"echaré","strong":"7993"},{"word":"sobre","strong":"5921"},{"word":"inmundicias","strong":"8251"},{"word":"afrentaré","strong":"5034"},{"word":"afrentaré","strong":"7760"},{"word":"estiércol","strong":"7210"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":3,"verse":7,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Todos los que te vieren se apartarán de ti, y dirán: Nínive es asolada; ¿quién se compadecerá de ella? ¿Dónde te buscaré consoladores?","strongTokens":[{"word":"Todos","strong":"3605"},{"word":"vieren","strong":"7200"},{"word":"apartarán","strong":"5074"},{"word":"de","strong":"4480"},{"word":"dirán","strong":"559"},{"word":"Nínive","strong":"5210"},{"word":"asolada","strong":"7703"},{"word":"quién","strong":"4310"},{"word":"quién","strong":"5110"},{"word":"quién","strong":"370"},{"word":"te","strong":"5162"},{"word":"buscaré","strong":"1245"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":3,"verse":8,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"¿Eres tú mejor que Tebas, que estaba asentada junto al Nilo, rodeada, de aguas, cuyo baluarte era el mar, y aguas por muro? •","strongTokens":[{"word":"mejor","strong":"3190"},{"word":"mejor","strong":"2869"},{"word":"mejor","strong":"4996"},{"word":"mejor","strong":"528"},{"word":"asentada","strong":"3427"},{"word":"Nilo","strong":"2975"},{"word":"rodeada","strong":"5439"},{"word":"aguas","strong":"4325"},{"word":"cuyo","strong":"834"},{"word":"baluarte","strong":"2426"},{"word":"mar","strong":"3220"},{"word":"aguas","strong":"3220"},{"word":"muro","strong":"2346"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":3,"verse":9,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Etiopía era su fortaleza, también Egipto, y eso sin límite; Fut y Libia fueron sus ayudadores.","strongTokens":[{"word":"Etiopía","strong":"3568"},{"word":"Etiopía","strong":"6109"},{"word":"Egipto","strong":"4714"},{"word":"sin","strong":"369"},{"word":"límite","strong":"7097"},{"word":"Fut","strong":"6316"},{"word":"Libia","strong":"3864"},{"word":"fueron","strong":"1961"},{"word":"fueron","strong":"5833"}]},{"bookId":"NAM","chapter":3,"verse":10,"version":"RVR1909","originalLanguage":"hebrew","text":"Sin embargo ella fue llevada en cautiverio; también sus pequeños fueron estrellados en las encrucijadas de todas las calles, y sobre sus varones echaron suertes, y todos sus grandes fueron aprisionados con grillos.","strongTokens":[{"word":"ella","strong":"1571"},{"word":"ella","strong":"1931"},{"word":"fue","strong":"1473"},{"word":"en","strong":"1980"},{"word":"también","strong":"7628"},{"word":"sus","strong":"1571"},{"word":"pequeños","strong":"1931"},{"word":"fueron","s